   "source_category": "Agile & delivery",
   "published": "2026-11-17T03:25:38+00:00",
   "summary": "\"Agent = Model + Harness\" describes one AI agent well and a team of agents badly. Once agents work together, the defects that matter come from handoffs, shared records and two agents doing the same work. A better model fixes none of those. A team needs a second line: Team = Agents + Coordination.",
